.coverage
# Anclado a la raíz de backend/: modelos pesados, salvo el modelo de visión
# versionado para que Docker y el endpoint local sean reproducibles.
/models/*
!/models/checksums.sha256
!/models/vision/
!/models/vision/README.md
!/models/vision/plant_disease_mobilenetv3.onnx
!/models/vision/model.onnx.data
!/models/vision/plant_disease_labels.json
*.gguf
/models/*.onnx
/data/
